<<^ code=`&#x0001;` from=`?` to=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/face.intent.answers`>>
<<^ code=`&#x0002;`>>

```toml meta
cacheable = true
l-space   = "stable"
role      = "answer an ask: approve or deny the act it names"
tags      = ["lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance", "lar:///face.intent.answers", "candidate"]
title     = "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/face.intent.answers"
type      = "text/memetic-wikitext+tiddlywiki"
uri-path  = "ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/face.intent.answers"
```

<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! face.intent.answers ~ answer ~ the answer shows the act it approves

`lares intent answer <ask-cid> --executor <atom>` signs the answer to an ask, approving (or with `--deny`, denying) the act it names, and prints the act it approves from the fold's own bytes: the verb, who asked, and the digest.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ approve

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`approve` params=`target/<ask-cid> executor/<atom> ~ approve the asked act`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ target · executor · deny · face

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`target` params=`takes/id needs/required seat/1 as/<target> ~ the ask's cid`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`executor` params=`takes/atom needs/required ~ the executor the answer names`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`deny` params=`~ deny instead of approve`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`face` params=`takes/index ~ the face whose intent plane this reads or writes, a whole persona index from 0`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ seat

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`seat` params=`who/seat-or-hand key/face-atom ~ signs under the face's own atom key through the store door`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · face-malformed · face-not-held · ask-or-executor-absent

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`~ an unknown sub-verb, or no sub-verb named`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`face-malformed` params=`~ --face names a whole persona index from 0`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`face-not-held` params=`~ this vessel holds no such face`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`ask-or-executor-absent` params=`~ name the ask and the executor`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ answered

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`answered` params=`exit/0 fields/[[cid shown]] ~ the act shown, then the cid`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares intent answer

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares intent answer]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

